{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00188",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 5.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Hello doctor, you know, sorry, am I early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.56,
      "end_seconds": 13.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.44,
      "end_seconds": 18.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Well, I've been having trouble reading small print."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.14,
      "end_seconds": 20.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Let's do your observations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.87,
      "end_seconds": 33.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Almost there..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.89,
      "end_seconds": 65.28,
      "duration_seconds": 12.39,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 17, pulse 70, blood pressure 119 over 71. And SpO2 99 percent on room air. Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.35,
      "end_seconds": 70.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I've had it for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.46,
      "end_seconds": 78.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.89,
      "end_seconds": 97.78,
      "duration_seconds": 17.89,
      "text": "Oh, a seven out of ten, I suppose. Only holding it further away, and it's not much. Oh, and glare from headlights at night. That's been about the same, about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.48,
      "end_seconds": 100.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Any tired eyes as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.5,
      "end_seconds": 104.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.34,
      "end_seconds": 108.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Is there anything that triggers it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.51,
      "end_seconds": 114.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Screens definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.48,
      "end_seconds": 119.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Have you had headaches after reading?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.25,
      "end_seconds": 133.48,
      "duration_seconds": 12.23,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, about a month. About headaches after reading, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. It happens every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.9,
      "end_seconds": 138.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Have you noticed redness, floaters or eye pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.61,
      "end_seconds": 143.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "I haven't had redness, floaters or eye pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.6,
      "end_seconds": 147.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.83,
      "end_seconds": 150.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.44,
      "end_seconds": 157.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.25,
      "end_seconds": 162.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I mean, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.76,
      "end_seconds": 169.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.34,
      "end_seconds": 179.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.33,
      "text": "I cycle to work most mornings. I skip breakfast most days. I work night shifts at a warehouse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.04,
      "end_seconds": 198.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.35,
      "end_seconds": 213.55,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.95,
      "end_seconds": 226.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.67,
      "end_seconds": 232.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "I take losartan, 50 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.69,
      "end_seconds": 238.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Right, is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.88,
      "end_seconds": 257.9,
      "duration_seconds": 18.02,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast. I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week. I had telmisartan at one point, but I'm off it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.43,
      "end_seconds": 263.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.29,
      "end_seconds": 269.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Hmm, my father had a stroke. My grandmother had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.91,
      "end_seconds": 273.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Any procedures or operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.92,
      "end_seconds": 278.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Just my gallbladder removed, in 2016."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.14,
      "end_seconds": 282.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Any diagnoses you've been given before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.25,
      "end_seconds": 302.56,
      "duration_seconds": 15.31,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for about ten years now. I've got diabetes. I have thin bones, for two years. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.78,
      "end_seconds": 307.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Right, let me check a few things physically."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.04,
      "end_seconds": 309.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.45,
      "end_seconds": 312.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Almost done with this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.03,
      "end_seconds": 335.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "The lens looks a little cloudy on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.17,
      "end_seconds": 339.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Hold that position for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.54,
      "end_seconds": 357.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Vision without glasses is six over twelve in both eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.43,
      "end_seconds": 362.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Good, that's the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.01,
      "end_seconds": 393.12,
      "duration_seconds": 12.11,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It's hard to say. A refractive problem or early cataracts is one possibility and diabetic eye changes another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.34,
      "end_seconds": 398.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Hmm, is this something I'll have for good?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.64,
      "end_seconds": 424.91,
      "duration_seconds": 24.27,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a refractive problem or early cataracts, and we'll know more once the a dilated eye examination is back. Just to be sure I understood. You've had trouble reading small print for nearly five years, and no eye pain or redness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.74,
      "end_seconds": 429.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Uh, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 431.13,
      "end_seconds": 443.07,
      "duration_seconds": 11.94,
      "text": "A dilated eye examination is what I'd like next, for blurred vision. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 443.82,
      "end_seconds": 446.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "The earliest is Friday, 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 448.45,
      "end_seconds": 470.15,
      "duration_seconds": 21.7,
      "text": "An eye pressure check is what I'd like next, for blurred vision. Get a proper glasses test, and keep your sugar and blood pressure well controlled for your eyes. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 471.33,
      "end_seconds": 472.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Okay, fair enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 473.73,
      "end_seconds": 487.0,
      "duration_seconds": 13.27,
      "text": "Do get help quickly if you get sudden loss of vision or a curtain across your sight. I'd like you back in four weeks. Right, that's all. Go gently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 487.6,
      "end_seconds": 490.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "All good here. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}